application_default_credentials.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
adc.json
**/adc.json

# Generic credential / token files (defense in depth)
credentials*.json
**/credentials*.json
token*.json
**/token*.json
auth*.json
**/auth*.json
*token*.json
*cred*.json

